      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Postgres: TX + outbox (source of truth)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Postgres: TX + outbox (source of truth)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lr2h_emXQHTNTLzYUCxH0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1152.943,
      "y": 923.7,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 658,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 737393372,
      "version": 997,
      "versionNonce": 788557276,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794751578027,
      "created": 1794735766930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow 1 - Buy Subscription\n1) Get userId from JWT; validate plan/voucher\nTX 1:\n2) Check request idempotency key + payload\n3) Create PENDING sub + invoice(period)\n4) Create PENDING payment attempt / PSP key\n5) Commit (NO PSP call inside DB TX)\nASYNCHRONOUS PAYMENT:\n6) Call PSP with SAME provider idempotency key\n7) Return 202 + PENDING + payment reference\n8) PSP sends signed webhook (may retry)\nTX 2:\n9) Verify signature; dedupe provider_event_id\n10) Lock invoice/payment; check valid state\n11) Payment=SUCCEEDED, invoice=PAID\n12) Sub=ACTIVE; advance paid_through once\n13) Insert voucher/notification outbox event\n14) Commit; relay -> Kafka -> consumers\n15) Client polls GET status or gets async push\n16) Unknown/lost webhook -> reconciliation\n\nFlow 2 - Auto Renew\n1) Scheduler selects due ACTIVE + auto_renew\n2) Atomic claim (SKIP LOCKED/CAS); recheck\n3) TX: UNIQUE invoice(sub_id, period)\n4) Create/reuse payment attempt; commit\n5) PSP charge OUTSIDE TX; use Flow 1 webhook\n6) On failure: retry/backoff + grace policy\n7) Keep current entitlement ACTIVE until expiry",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow 1 - Buy Subscription\n1) Get userId from JWT; validate plan/voucher\nTX 1:\n2) Check request idempotency key + payload\n3) Create PENDING sub + invoice(period)\n4) Create PENDING payment attempt / PSP key\n5) Commit (NO PSP call inside DB TX)\nASYNCHRONOUS PAYMENT:\n6) Call PSP with SAME provider idempotency key\n7) Return 202 + PENDING + payment reference\n8) PSP sends signed webhook (may retry)\nTX 2:\n9) Verify signature; dedupe provider_event_id\n10) Lock invoice/payment; check valid state\n11) Payment=SUCCEEDED, invoice=PAID\n12) Sub=ACTIVE; advance paid_through once\n13) Insert voucher/notification outbox event\n14) Commit; relay -> Kafka -> consumers\n15) Client polls GET status or gets async push\n16) Unknown/lost webhook -> reconciliation\n\nFlow 2 - Auto Renew\n1) Scheduler selects due ACTIVE + auto_renew\n2) Atomic claim (SKIP LOCKED/CAS); recheck\n3) TX: UNIQUE invoice(sub_id, period)\n4) Create/reuse payment attempt; commit\n5) PSP charge OUTSIDE TX; use Flow 1 webhook\n6) On failure: retry/backoff + grace policy\n7) Keep current entitlement ACTIVE until expiry",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "-bbfzTM-Eatx1Y3I1UjSF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2530,
      "y": 121,
      "width": 545,
      "height": 972,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 152379868,
      "version": 648,
      "versionNonce": 1186231012,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794751421760,
      "created": 1794735895704,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plans\n- id (PK)\n- name, price, currency\n- billing_interval, plan_version\n- active\n\nSubscriptions\n- id (PK)\n- user_id INDEX, plan_id\n- start_at, paid_through\n- status: PENDING | ACTIVE | CANCELED\n- auto_renew, cancel_at_period_end\n- version (optimistic lock)\n\nInvoices (Billings)\n- id (PK), subscription_id\n- period_start, period_end\n- amount, currency, status\n- UNIQUE(sub_id, start, end)\n\nPaymentAttempts\n- id (PK), invoice_id\n- provider_ref UNIQUE\n- provider_idempotency_key UNIQUE\n- status: PENDING | UNKNOWN |\n  SUCCEEDED | FAILED\n\nVouchers\n- id, code UNIQUE, user_id\n- status: NEW | RESERVED | USED\n- invoice_id?, redeemed_at?\n- atomic redemption; no double use\n\nOutboxEvents\n- id PK, event_type, payload\n- published_at, attempts\n\nWebhookInbox\n- provider_event_id UNIQUE\n- processed_at, result\n\nBilling stores PSP token/reference,\nNOT card number or CVV.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Plans\n- id (PK)\n- name, price, currency\n- billing_interval, plan_version\n- active\n\nSubscriptions\n- id (PK)\n- user_id INDEX, plan_id\n- start_at, paid_through\n- status: PENDING | ACTIVE | CANCELED\n- auto_renew, cancel_at_period_end\n- version (optimistic lock)\n\nInvoices (Billings)\n- id (PK), subscription_id\n- period_start, period_end\n- amount, currency, status\n- UNIQUE(sub_id, start, end)\n\nPaymentAttempts\n- id (PK), invoice_id\n- provider_ref UNIQUE\n- provider_idempotency_key UNIQUE\n- status: PENDING | UNKNOWN |\n  SUCCEEDED | FAILED\n\nVouchers\n- id, code UNIQUE, user_id\n- status: NEW | RESERVED | USED\n- invoice_id?, redeemed_at?\n- atomic redemption; no double use\n\nOutboxEvents\n- id PK, event_type, payload\n- published_at, attempts\n\nWebhookInbox\n- provider_event_id UNIQUE\n- processed_at, result\n\nBilling stores PSP token/reference,\nNOT card number or CVV.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
