    {
      "id": "-5kt9WtAyMoJ1nb01wWar",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1846,
      "y": 1715,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 365,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1871440612,
      "version": 1109,
      "versionNonce": 1481659740,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794751859616,
      "created": 1794751597369,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFR Explain / Trade-offs:\n1) Availability: multi-AZ DB, failover;\n   stateless API; payment writes fail closed.\n2) Consistency: ACID within PostgreSQL;\n   ACID != CAP/CP. Strong reads for billing.\n3) Latency: p95 status <100ms, buy-init\n   <200ms, EXCLUDING async PSP settlement.\n4) Durability: DB state + outbox in one TX.\n   Relay via polling/CDC; Kafka at-least-once.\n5) Reliability: idempotency at API, PSP,\n   webhook & consumer. UNIQUE invoice(period).\n6) Scalability: estimate read/write separately.\n   Replica/cache for noncritical reads;\n   index/partition before costly sharding.\n7) Reconcile UNKNOWN/stuck PSP payments.\n   Alert on old PENDING or overdue renewals.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NFR Explain / Trade-offs:\n1) Availability: multi-AZ DB, failover;\n   stateless API; payment writes fail closed.\n2) Consistency: ACID within PostgreSQL;\n   ACID != CAP/CP. Strong reads for billing.\n3) Latency: p95 status <100ms, buy-init\n   <200ms, EXCLUDING async PSP settlement.\n4) Durability: DB state + outbox in one TX.\n   Relay via polling/CDC; Kafka at-least-once.\n5) Reliability: idempotency at API, PSP,\n   webhook & consumer. UNIQUE invoice(period).\n6) Scalability: estimate read/write separately.\n   Replica/cache for noncritical reads;\n   index/partition before costly sharding.\n7) Reconcile UNKNOWN/stuck PSP payments.\n   Alert on old PENDING or overdue renewals.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZKnbv7qw-ttGhlqpKrOq1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2699,
      "y": 1675,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1251667044,
      "version": 488,
      "versionNonce": 979075548,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794752053010,
      "created": 1794751904173,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Monitoring:\n- API RPS, errors, p95/p99 latency\n- payment success, UNKNOWN age\n- failed/overdue renewals\n- webhook retries, outbox age\n- Kafka lag, DLQ, reconciliation gaps\n- DB lock waits, slow queries\n\nTesting:\n- duplicate client requests/webhooks\n- cancel vs renewal concurrency race\n- PSP timeout, DB crash, Kafka outage\n- provider contract + integration tests\n- load test against p95 latency\n\nSecurity:\n- JWT, authZ per subscription owner\n- webhook signature + replay protection\n- PSP tokenization (no raw card storage)\n- TLS, secret vault, audit logs",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Monitoring:\n- API RPS, errors, p95/p99 latency\n- payment success, UNKNOWN age\n- failed/overdue renewals\n- webhook retries, outbox age\n- Kafka lag, DLQ, reconciliation gaps\n- DB lock waits, slow queries\n\nTesting:\n- duplicate client requests/webhooks\n- cancel vs renewal concurrency race\n- PSP timeout, DB crash, Kafka outage\n- provider contract + integration tests\n- load test against p95 latency\n\nSecurity:\n- JWT, authZ per subscription owner\n- webhook signature + replay protection\n- PSP tokenization (no raw card storage)\n- TLS, secret vault, audit logs",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
